                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The administrators said their work comes from passion, not politics. They worry that the shutdown could further harm important programs, resulting in less food for their communities. They believe it is essential to maintain access to healthy food to prevent long-term health problems.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
